ID
T}	T{
Codec
T}	T{
Description
T}
_
T{
1
T}	T{
CVSD
T}	T{
Narrow band (8 kHz), mandatory
T}
_
T{
2
T}	T{
mSBC
T}	T{
Wide band speech (16 kHz)
T}
_
T{
3
T}	T{
LC3\-SWB
T}	T{
Super wide band (32 kHz), HFP 1.9+
T}
.TE
.sp
These HFP\-level codec IDs differ from HCI codec IDs.
.SS Voice Setting
.sp
Before SCO/eSCO setup, the host configures the voice setting. For
CVSD, the air coding format is CVSD; for mSBC or LC3\-SWB, it must be
set to Transparent Data:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
< HCI Command: Write Voice Setting (0x0c|0x0026) plen 2
      Setting: 0x0063
        Input Coding: Linear
        Input Data Format: 2\(aqs complement
        Input Sample Size: 16\-bit
        # of bits padding at MSB: 0
        Air Coding Format: Transparent Data
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
For CVSD:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
< HCI Command: Write Voice Setting (0x0c|0x0026) plen 2
      Setting: 0x0060
        Input Coding: Linear
        Input Data Format: 2\(aqs complement
        Input Sample Size: 16\-bit
        # of bits padding at MSB: 0
        Air Coding Format: CVSD
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS SCO/eSCO Connection Setup
.sp
After codec negotiation, the host establishes a synchronous connection
for voice audio.
.sp
\fBSetup Synchronous Connection\fP (basic):
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
< HCI Command: Setup Synchronous Connection (0x01|0x0028) plen 17
      Handle: 1
      Transmit bandwidth: 8000
      Receive bandwidth: 8000
      Max latency: 13
      Setting: 0x0063
        Input Coding: Linear
        Input Data Format: 2\(aqs complement
        Input Sample Size: 16\-bit
        # of bits padding at MSB: 0
        Air Coding Format: Transparent Data
      Retransmission effort: Optimize for link quality (0x02)
      Packet type: 0x0008
        EV3 may be used
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBEnhanced Setup Synchronous Connection\fP (codec\-aware):
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
< HCI Command: Enhanced Setup Synchronous Connection (0x01|0x003d) plen 59
      Handle: 1
      Transmit bandwidth: 8000
      Receive bandwidth: 8000
      Transmit Coding Format:
        Codec: mSBC (0x05)
      Receive Coding Format:
        Codec: mSBC (0x05)
      Transmit Codec Frame Size: 60
      Receive Codec Frame Size: 60
      Input Coding Format:
        Codec: mSBC (0x05)
      Output Coding Format:
        Codec: mSBC (0x05)
      Input Coded Data Size: 16
      Output Coded Data Size: 16
      Input PCM Data Format: 2\(aqs complement
      Output PCM Data Format: 2\(aqs complement
      Input PCM Sample Payload MSB Position: 0
      Output PCM Sample Payload MSB Position: 0
      Input Data Path: HCI
      Output Data Path: HCI
      Input Transport Unit Size: 60
      Output Transport Unit Size: 60
      Max latency: 13
      Packet type: 0x0008
        EV3 may be used
      Retransmission effort: Optimize for link quality (0x02)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
